                            <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">Selects Alternate values used in Adc_SetClockMode API for programming CTR Conversion Timing Registers.
                              This container is EDITABLE only if &quot;Adc Conversion Time Once&quot; is disabled and &quot;Adc Set Clock Mode API&quot; is enabled. Hardware averaging functionality is also available for configuration if supported.</L-2>
                          </DESC>
